Package: covidpbmc
Type: Project
Title: Reproducible Single-Cell RNA-seq Analysis of COVID-19 PBMCs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Khaled", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Marwan", role = "aut")
    )
Description:
    A reproducible single-cell RNA-seq analysis project for investigating
    immune-cell composition and transcriptional programs in COVID-19
    peripheral blood mononuclear cells. The project emphasizes modular R
    development, reproducibility, testing, workflow management, and
    collaborative software engineering.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
